  "worked_solution": "Using the properties of addition/subtraction and scalar multiplication of vectors to isolate $x,$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2a+4x & =b \\\\ 4x & =b-2a \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{4}(b-2a) \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{4}([\\begin{aligned}14 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]-2[\\begin{aligned}5 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 6\\end{aligned}]) \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{4}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -4 \\\\ -12\\end{aligned}] \\\\ x & =[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -3\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
